# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets ignore list — the third counterpart to
# `exclude:` in _config.yml (GitHub Pages) and .vercelignore (Vercel).
#
# wrangler.jsonc sets `assets.directory: "."`, so WITHOUT this file every file
# in the repo root is uploaded and served by the Worker — including the question
# banks. Each of the three platforms honours only its own list and ignores the
# other two, so a path added to one almost always belongs in all three.
#
# NOTE (2026-08): the live website is the React app in `neurole-react/`, which
# is its own Vercel project. This Cloudflare Worker (`name: neurole-site`) only
# applied when the static site was served straight off the repo root.
#
# Nothing is deleted; removing a line republishes the path.

# --- Non-deployed assets ---------------------------------------------------
# The designated archive/dump folder: every image, spreadsheet and zip. Stays
# out of any root-served deployment. The duplicate whole-site copy that used to
# need an entry here was deleted outright instead — an exclusion only stops a
# host publishing a path, while anyone reading the repo still sees it and one
# edit to this list puts it back on the web.
assets/

# --- Designated zips & spreadsheets ---------------------------------------
# All question banks live under assets/ now (not the root), answers included.
# The live games read the published Google Sheet CSV, so nothing fetches these.
*.xlsx

# --- Source archives -------------------------------------------------------
# Old whole-site snapshot zips and the daily/neuroanatomy game source zips.
*.zip

# --- React app -------------------------------------------------------------
# The actual website: source, not build output. Deployed as its own Vercel
# project. Serving this from the root would expose the whole codebase.
neurole-react/

# --- Not part of the website -----------------------------------------------
# Worker source itself lives at neurole-react/scripts/ai-worker.js; it runs as
# the Worker (or its own deployment), it is not an asset to serve.
wrangler.jsonc
package.json
package-lock.json
*.md

# --- Other platforms' config -----------------------------------------------
_config.yml
CNAME
vercel.json
.vercelignore
.gitignore
.assetsignore